commit 3dd2bfa2704c60a103f28ba9455a25c100eae083
Author:     Vineet Deo <vineet@thunderbird.net>
AuthorDate: Tue Apr 28 21:59:37 2026 +0000
Commit:     Vineet Deo <vineet@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Tue Apr 28 21:59:37 2026 +0000

    Bug 2033746 - Account Hub -moz-number-spinbox not filling the height of the port form input. r=aleca


    I've increased the size slightly and and the size of the padding slightly to make the stepper more clickable as part of this fix.

    **How to Test**
    - Open account hub and go to manual config by typing in an email and clicking manual config
    - The number stepper should fill the height of the port form input and should be easily clickable

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D295950

diff --git a/mail/themes/shared/mail/accountHubForms.css b/mail/themes/shared/mail/accountHubForms.css
index aad45f9d94c..6ac7f9e45fd 100644
--- a/mail/themes/shared/mail/accountHubForms.css
+++ b/mail/themes/shared/mail/accountHubForms.css
@@ -169,24 +169,25 @@ form {

     &.number-input {
       padding-inline-end: 0;
-      border-radius: 4px;
-      border-width: 1px;

       &::-moz-number-spin-box {
         block-size: 100%;
+        padding-block: var(--hub-form-input-block-padding);
         inline-size: 22px;
         border-inline-start: 1px solid var(--color-surface-border);
         border-inline-end: 0;
+        border-start-end-radius: var(--hub-input-border-radius);
+        border-end-end-radius: var(--hub-input-border-radius);
         background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
-        align-items: center;
         cursor: pointer;
+        position: relative;
+        z-index: 2;
       }

       &::-moz-number-spin-up,
       &::-moz-number-spin-down {
-        block-size: 8px;
         appearance: none;
-        padding: 5px 2px;
+        padding: calc(var(--hub-form-input-block-padding) / 2);
         -moz-context-properties: stroke;
         stroke: currentColor;
         cursor: pointer;
@@ -198,6 +199,7 @@ form {
       }

       &::-moz-number-spin-down {
+        border-block-start: 1px solid var(--color-surface-subtle);
         content: var(--icon-nav-down-sm);
       }
     }
